# Open kan (daiminkan) -> immediate Rinshan Kaihou tsumo does NOT count the owed kan dora
# (engine.md §4.2, rules.md §4.17).
# Seat 0 discards 5z -> Seat 1 calls daiminkan on 5z, draws rinshan 4m -> tsumo!
# Dora indicators: 1z -> dora 2z (0 dora); 2nd indicator 4z (-> 5z, +4 dora!) is NOT flipped yet.
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Hand: 23m 678m 234p 567s 88p + daiminkan 5555z + rinshan tsumo 4m
#   Yaku: yakuhai_haku (1) + rinshan (1) = 2 han (NO kan dora!).
#   Fu: 20 base + 2 tsumo + 16 minkan(5z) = 38 -> 40 fu.
#   Non-dealer tsumo 2 han 40 fu: 700 from non-dealers (Seats 2, 3), 1300 from dealer (Seat 0).
#   Total to Seat 1: 700 + 700 + 1300 = 2700.

[meta]
name: open_kan_rinshan_no_kan_dora
title: Rinshan tsumo immediately after an open kan does not see the owed kan dora
rules: mahjongsoul
source: engine.md §4.2, rules.md §4.17

[round]
