hand 2: 1199m 5566p 223s 8s 7z
hand 3: 3344m 77p 44p 3344s 6z
dora: 1z 4z
rinshan: 4m
draws: 2z

[steps]
0 discard 5z
window: 1=daiminkan
1 tsumo

[expect]
